    # Research
    I am interested in the field of computational biology, specifically 
    in developing methods to construct cellular and gene regulatory 
    networks from gene expression data. I am interested in the use of 
    parallel computing in the application of machine learning methods 
    for the problem of biological network construction. I will have 
    more to say later, when I dive in.

