    # Past Life
    In the past life, I used to work as a software engineer in a
    consultancy company. I have eight (and a half) years of experience in 
    being a code monkey and managing code monkeys churning 
    hundreds of lines of code, to make computers help humans manage 
    different versions of engineering designs. In other words, I used 
    to develop software that manages a product's (such as an aircraft engine)
    life-cycle from inception to maintenance. A summary of my past work is
